#. macro: <num $month> — a number; value = month of the set time (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <num $year> — a number; value = year of the set time (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "Addon:15388:0:0"
msgid "<if ($n1 > 0)>Completion Time: <set-time $n1><if $hour><switch $hour><case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}<case>{12}<case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}</switch><else>{12}</if>:<num2 $min> <if ($hour >= 12)>p.m.<else>a.m.</if> <if ($gn77 == 3)><num $day>/<num $month>/<num $year><else><num $month>/<num $day>/<num $year></if><else>Expansion Complete</if>"
msgstr "<if ($n1 > 0)>Завершение: <set-time $n1><if $hour><switch $hour><case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}<case>{12}<case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}</switch><else>{12}</if>:<num2 $min> <if ($gn77 == 3)><num $day>.<num $month>.<num $year><else><num $day>.<num $month>.<num $year></if><else>Расширение завершено</if>"

